          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"id\":64,\"filmId\":51,\"screeningDate\":\"2026-01-22T20:45\",\"doorsTime\":\"8.15pm\",\"filmTime\":\"8.45pm\",\"capacity\":37,\"ticketsSold\":37,\"price\":1100,\"format\":\"Digital\",\"excludeFromGiftVouchers\":false,\"film\":{\"id\":51,\"title\":\"BEAUTY AND THE BEAST\",\"description\":\"A humble village girl becomes the captive of a grotesque Beast, a figure both terrifying and tragic. As she navigates his eerie, shadow-filled castle, fear gives way to curiosity and compassion, revealing the humanity hidden beneath his monstrous exterior.\\n\\nA darkly gothic and visually striking fairy tale, Juraj Herz’s Beauty and the Beast blends horror and romance, exploring obsession, transformation, and the thin line between terror and tenderness.\",\"runtime\":91,\"year\":1978,\"country\":\"Czechoslovakia\",\"director\":\"Juraj Herz\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://freight.cargo.site/w/800/q/75/i/76a26d5324354b104c7d85e4dc2610a4c346d366d39c7bfca06339de6d2ff3f6/Screenshot-2025-11-30-at-21.03.55.png\",\"imageCropX\":50,\"imageCropY\":50,\"ageCertificate\":\"15\"}}",
