          "redirectURL": "",
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"id\":92,\"filmId\":2,\"screeningDate\":\"2026-02-02T18:30\",\"doorsTime\":\"6pm\",\"filmTime\":\"6.30pm\",\"capacity\":38,\"ticketsSold\":0,\"price\":1100,\"format\":\"Digital\",\"excludeFromGiftVouchers\":false,\"film\":{\"id\":2,\"title\":\"THE EXORCIST III\",\"description\":\"On the fifteenth anniversary of the exorcism that claimed Father Damien Karras’ life, Police Lieutenant Kinderman’s world is once again shattered when a boy is found decapitated and savagely crucified.\\n\\nBlatty resurrects the philosophical and spiritual dread of the original Exorcist, not through spectacle but through mood, rhythm, and the grim patience of police procedural. The film slips between dream logic and grounded investigation as Kinderman confronts murders that echo a killer long dead.\",\"runtime\":116,\"year\":1990,\"country\":\"USA\",\"director\":\"William Peter Blatty\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://d13jj08vfqimqg.cloudfront.net/uploads/article/header_marquee/2534/large_EIII_-_header_pic.png\",\"imageCropX\":50,\"imageCropY\":50,\"ageCertificate\":\"18\"}}",
