          "redirectURL": "",
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"id\":112,\"filmId\":30,\"screeningDate\":\"2026-02-12T18:30\",\"doorsTime\":\"6pm\",\"filmTime\":\"6:30pm\",\"capacity\":37,\"ticketsSold\":1,\"price\":1100,\"format\":\"Digital\",\"excludeFromGiftVouchers\":false,\"film\":{\"id\":30,\"title\":\"THE CREMATOR\",\"description\":\"Karel, a mild-mannered crematorium worker, becomes increasingly obsessed with the idea of “cleansing” humanity through death, aligning his private rituals with the rise of Nazi ideology. As his moral compass erodes, he descends into madness, turning the people around him into victims of his delusional sense of duty.\\n\\n\\nA darkly comic and chilling horror, The Cremator blends psychological terror with surreal satire, offering a haunting meditation on complicity, obsession, and the banality of evil.\",\"runtime\":101,\"year\":1969,\"country\":\"Czechoslovakia\",\"director\":\"Juraj Herz\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://freight.cargo.site/w/800/q/75/i/be427f4e70cbf9be82e962b08cb6377a23975a594f42c050d61920a65a030f59/Screenshot-2025-11-27-at-23.06.44.png\",\"imageCropX\":50,\"imageCropY\":50,\"ageCertificate\":\"18\"}}",
