          "cookies": [],
          "redirectURL": "",
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"id\":118,\"filmId\":20,\"screeningDate\":\"2026-02-14T20:45\",\"doorsTime\":\"8:15pm\",\"filmTime\":\"8:45pm\",\"capacity\":37,\"ticketsSold\":1,\"price\":1100,\"format\":\"Digital\",\"excludeFromGiftVouchers\":false,\"film\":{\"id\":20,\"title\":\"CAFE FLESH\",\"description\":\"In a post-apocalyptic world where most survivors are “sex negatives,” human intimacy has become a stage act performed for the immune few. At the surreal nightclub Café Flesh, performers cycle through bizarre, dreamlike routines while the uninfected audience watches with hungry detachment. When a man discovers he might not be “negative” after all, the revelation threatens the uneasy balance of desire and despair holding the place together.\\n\\n\\nA cult landmark of punk-infused erotica and midnight-movie surrealism, Café Flesh blends cabaret spectacle with dystopian melancholy. The result is a strange, intoxicating vision of lust, alienation, and performance at the end of the world.\",\"runtime\":75,\"year\":1982,\"country\":\"USA\",\"director\":\"Stephen Sayadian\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://freight.cargo.site/w/800/q/75/i/a774c3c2c9023dccca5fd62001d3231c0434bfcebde702fd4032714464168b6b/Screenshot-2025-11-27-at-21.50.59.png\",\"imageCropX\":50,\"imageCropY\":50,\"ageCertificate\":\"18\"}}",
