          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"id\":121,\"filmId\":6,\"screeningDate\":\"2026-02-16T18:30\",\"doorsTime\":\"6pm\",\"filmTime\":\"6:30pm\",\"capacity\":37,\"ticketsSold\":0,\"price\":1100,\"format\":\"Digital\",\"excludeFromGiftVouchers\":false,\"film\":{\"id\":6,\"title\":\"WAKE IN FRIGHT\",\"description\":\"A young schoolteacher descends into personal moral degradation after finding himself stranded in a brutal, menacing town in outback Australia.\\n\\nA descent into a uniquely Australian hell, Kotcheff’s outback nightmare traps its protagonist in a cycle of drink, violence, and ritualised masculinity. The film’s oppressive heat and unbroken tension evoke a place where social norms evaporate under the sun.\",\"runtime\":114,\"year\":1971,\"country\":\"Australia\",\"director\":\"Ted Kotcheff\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://freight.cargo.site/w/1500/q/75/i/9515e1958528ce6018cd52e813205ad4ae765d37b2bd70b670e84ce9c1fa7621/Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-16.48.03.png\",\"imageCropX\":50,\"imageCropY\":50,\"ageCertificate\":\"18\"}}",
